      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "小时爬行的距离分别为多少米？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "844",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "844. 长方体长$\\frac{4}{9}$米，宽$\\frac{3}{4}$米，高$\\frac{1}{3}$米，求它的体积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "845",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "845. 把下列各数化成假分数：",
        "$2\\frac{3}{4}$；　$3\\frac{4}{7}$；　$20\\frac{1}{17}$；　$14\\frac{15}{37}$；　5.24；　8.25."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "846",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "846. 计算：",
        "1) $3\\frac{3}{5}\\cdot1\\frac{1}{9}$；　3) $2\\frac{2}{25}\\cdot1\\frac{9}{16}$；　5) $-6\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot10\\frac{1}{8}$；",
        "2) $2\\frac{14}{15}\\cdot6\\frac{6}{11}$；　4) $\\frac{13}{43}\\cdot8\\frac{7}{26}$；　6) $-5\\frac{5}{6}\\cdot\\left(-6\\frac{6}{7}\\right)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "847",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "847. 瓜地收获27吨西瓜，其中$\\frac{2}{9}$送到食堂，剩余西瓜的$\\frac{6}{7}$送",
        "到市场. 送到市场的西瓜有多少吨？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "848",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "848. 1立方分米铁的质量等于$7\\frac{4}{5}$公斤，求边长为$2\\frac{1}{2}$分米",
        "的立方体铁块的质量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "849",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "849. 早晨，一辆汽车以43.2公里/小时的速度从某城驶出.",
        "0.7小时后，一辆载重汽车跟在这辆公共汽车之后开出，",
        "从该城到目的地的距离是151.2公里. 载重汽车和公共",
        "汽车同时到达. 求载重汽车的速度？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "850",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "850. 某数比另一个数大0.8. 这两个数的算术平均数为2.7，",
        "求某数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "851",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "851. 设：$a=b=-0.2$，求式$2.3\\cdot(a-2b)-4.1(a+b)$的值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
